# Git

- Commit after a slice works, not after “the whole app”.
- Message is why (`feat: hold posts behind an explicit review action`), not a file list.
- Push `origin HEAD` after each slice. Never `--force`. Never `--no-verify`.
- Do not commit `.env`, secrets, `.DS_Store`, `node_modules`, or `data/queue/*` runtime files.
- Leave incomplete work uncommitted rather than marking it as done.
